# Message:
#   Happy Holidays Mega Commit Part 1 (CvCityAI)
#   You can now use the BUILDINGFOCUS_WONDEROK flag, wonders will not be chosen unless WONDEROK or WORLDWONDER is set. WORLDWONDER if set alone excludes all non-worldwonder buildings. WONDEROK should not be set alone - it is intended to be used ONLY with other focusflags, if no flags are set then wonders are assumed to be ok.
#   Wonderbuilding in chooseProduction has been changed to make use of the new flag functionality.
#   
#   You can now pass a threshold to "bestBuilding", this only looks at the Pass0 results and as such is only intended to be used with focusflags. buildingValue has been tweaked so that all building values are more comparable. This new functionality is used by OR'ing the gold, research, maintenance, happy, healthy and specialist flags and having it simply select the most profitable building from any of those - pruning those which don't meet the threshold.
#   
#   Various changes to the best build (smarter chopping), better order of building improvements (cottages are higher priority).
#   AI Whipping has been fixed so it works again.
#   AI uses Emphasis buttons more selectively and they generally wont override the new city specialization stuff (ie cities pumping out a wonder wont decide to emp great people).
#   The governor should prefer production slightly more, he should also always prefer hamlets over cottages.
# Changed paths (8):
